{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":745205,\"title\":\"And There Was Light\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A man determines to kill himself every day, but continues with his life because he forgets to end himself due to alcoholic dementia. A severely alcoholic woman is living her life under grief and helplessness. These two utter strangers run into each other and set off to finish their lives together.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fHUSP7FNOmROvicsBCFHnIqZFuU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3vkJJQDvdUsnuBKA5gVtJgoG4D.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2022,\"runtime\":108,\"genres\":[\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"KR\",\"name\":\"South Korea\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Kim Ji-seok\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2786665,\"name\":\"Kim Ji-seok\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2255388,\"name\":\"Kang Gil-woo\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uSQd4PdX8hGH8MBlLtf5g3eyojO.jpg\"},{\"id\":1694079,\"name\":\"Park Ga-young\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jJRM1EPWQjl7Zd5V8E4pOY2Kcl9.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":791177,\"title\":\"Bones and All\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dBQuk2LkHjrDsSjueirPQg96GCc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8sPxa4sdRvjgRG3GgkO8RQxUR9P.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Abandoned by her father, a young woman embarks on a thousand-mile odyssey through the backroads of America where she meets a disenfranchised drifter. But despite their best efforts, all roads lead back to their terrifying pasts and to a final stand that will determine whether their love can survive their otherness.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":61202,\"title\":\"Zindagi Na Milegi Dobara\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hKO9O715wYxjkQSEv47giCYcyO8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z4k7b66jAHP8sQbEahxss6Ct8BW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three friends who were inseparable in childhood decide to go on a three-week-long bachelor road trip to Spain, in order to re-establish their bond and explore thrilling adventures, before one of them gets married. What will they learn of themselves and each other during the adventure?\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13198,\"title\":\"Wristcutters: A Love Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qModiIR60IMLP28ruGZluQOtsOj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wDLgGI6Rswo30YkWoM6TGq0VWVy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Zia, distraught over breaking up with his girlfriend, decides to end it all. Unfortunately, he discovers that there is no real ending, only a run-down afterlife that is strikingly similar to his old one, just a bit worse. Discovering that his ex-girlfriend has also \\\"offed\\\" herself, he sets out on a road trip to find her.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6183,\"title\":\"Barefoot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gAoSSuWskaixnrFUXJwHwTuEfzt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eI70OmCCWYk99ZYxmR2PEFq6Yd1.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A hedonistic bachelor - he is his rich family's black sheep - falls for a suicidal mental patient.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8651,\"title\":\"En Route\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tew3nZObTsXB7AHelNQSca8MTR9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A slightly sinister but charming young man falls in with a young mother and daughter and her boyfriend on a camping holiday and leads them astray.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14552,\"title\":\"Have Dreams, Will Travel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jMHkxZS8HEPbwyskI2KZRLKD4mb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pWZm7nkG6MCBzPagrpPeCEbYQk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"West Texas, in the 1960's. A tale of two 12-year-olds who embark on an adventure to find new parents in order to escape their unhappy and emotionally unsatisfying family life.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":357441,\"title\":\"Karachi Se Lahore\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xpzhyTnsuS2eX2eYb8SUCotbovn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lIUQ28eubM0aLL8yJ33Bl9gIFVp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A road trip from Karachi to Lahore where 5 friends discover themselves and the country amidst getting to their destination.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2349,\"title\":\"Erbsen auf halb 6\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8dHHRyyIxhSf2xn7Dp93BtopMlm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kvMYG2H7KVqJOHgbiDNQ0cdMMVr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It all starts with a bang. The car breaks through the crash barrier and falls off the bridge. The lights go out. After that, he is not able to see anymore. His optic nerve is severed, from now on the young stage-director Jakob is blind. His life will change and nothing will ever be the same. Jakob cannot handle the idea of never being able to see again and screams at the only woman who is able and willing to help him, Lily. A rehabilitation teacher, she helps the blind deal with the darkness. Lily has been living with it since birth, she too is blind.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":300506,\"title\":\"Nerungi Vaa Muthamidathe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fzRNpO0r0Ps3QNHm109FllPyzlg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iDTWngMG23cyTZH58t40L2QbUXD.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nerungi Vaa Muthamidathe is a road film that revolves around a trip from Trichy to Karaikal shot in the backdrop of a petrol crisis.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":331460,\"title\":\"The Romantic Exiles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9XNBQpcmfmmvWg7AgQA7ZErj9e6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s2EKgooFVbUBsjGIb54nZEwbFLE.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Vito, Luis and Francesco are three Spanish friends around thirty who travel by van to Paris for no apparent reason, just looking for a reunion with their respective ancient, idyllic and yet ephemeral love affairs, perhaps with the only mission of surprising themselves and continue to still feel alive.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6156,\"title\":\"Sehnsucht nach Rimini\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xpaEBy4kODMMqvmQ5EmaNMhAwmA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After surviving a heart attack, bus company owner Marianne Toeplitz should actually be more concerned about her health than her ailing business. But she only does this after an argument with her daughter Susanne, who wants to merge with the competition. Against all reason, Marianne sets off for Italy with her granddaughter: Teenager Nellie is in love and wants to join her boyfriend in Rimini - where Marianne experienced an unforgettable romance with the charming Giuseppe many years ago. Susanne follows the two runaways and gets closer to her ex-husband again. Marianne also learns that old love never rusts.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12800,\"title\":\"Gasoline\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1YPxI4SVPW